@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@importId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Upload a CSV
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/imports
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CsvBoundary

--CsvBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="customers.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

name,email,phone
Ada Lovelace,ada@example.com,+442079460123
Grace Hopper,grace@example.com,+12025550184
--CsvBoundary--

### Get one import (replace importId after uploading)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/imports/{{importId}}
Accept: application/json

### List recent imports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/imports?page=1&limit=10
Accept: application/json
